# Escape Tunnel fetches a basic land card: the Triome is nonbasic, so it may not be found (the refusal sits beside the
# basic Forest that is).

[Bot1 Deck]
Escape Tunnel
Island x6
Ketria Triome
Forest
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Escape Tunnel.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Escape Tunnel.Activate(Ability: Search your library)
! Bot1.Search(Ketria Triome)
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
